description:
Tel Aviv’s city center is perhaps one of the most enviable areas of the entire country. Known for its exciting nightlife, never-ending shopping, and crystal-clear beaches, locals and tourists alike jump at the opportunity to settle here. The promenade along the coast is just few minutes walk away and is a great place to spend a day, working on your tan, sipping a cocktail in one of the beach-side bars or having dinner in one of the upscale restaurants. Gordon beach ( one of the most famous) is a minute’s walk away. Dizengoff Center, one of the most popular shopping arcades in the city, is also a short walk away, as is the popular Bograshov Street, home to some of the greatest restaurants cafes and boutiques the city has to offer.

Description and Layout

This stunning three bedroom rooftop duplex is designed with pure elegance and modern finishings. Bright and airy, the apartment has a multitude of windows surrounding the space, as well as two massive balconies, perfect for soaking up the Tel-Aviv sun. This gorgeous, spacious apartment has ceilings as high as the sky and an open kitchen and living room layout that will make entertaining a pure joy. Wood flooring throughout and sleek finishings provide an atmosphere of absolute elegance and luxury. With three bedrooms and two bathrooms separated on two floors, you’ll feel space and serenity in the city center. A true gem in the heart of Tel Aviv!

